# Checking a server before any account details are saved should say the
# account is missing, not that the action "isn't available".
wait-for Your shelf is empty
tap Browse
wait-for Connect Komga
tap Add server address
wait-for HTTPS address
type https://komga.invalid
tap Use address
wait-for https://komga.invalid
tap Check connection
wait-idle
wait 1500
clean
shot komga-check-no-account
expect-missing This action isn't available.
